@startuml
title "MyNotes Application - Control Flow Graph"

state "Start" as Start
state "A" as InitialCheck
state "B" as AuthDecision
state "C" as ShowNotesList
state "D" as InteractionLoop
state "E" as ActionDispatch
state "F" as AddNote
state "G" as EditNote
state "H" as SaveChangesDecision
state "I" as UpdateNote
state "J" as NetworkDecision
state "K" as SyncFirebase
state "L" as QueueSync
state "M" as ReturnToList
state "N" as DiscardChanges
state "O" as DeleteNote
state "P" as ConfirmDeleteDecision
state "Q" as PerformDeletion
state "R" as CancelDeletion
state "S" as SignOut
state "T" as ShowSignIn
state "U" as SignInDecision
state "V" as SignInSuccess
state "W" as SignInFailure
state "End" as End

[*] --> Start
Start --> InitialCheck : User opens app
InitialCheck --> AuthDecision : Check authentication

AuthDecision --> ShowNotesList : [Authenticated]
AuthDecision --> ShowSignIn : [Not Authenticated]

ShowNotesList --> InteractionLoop
InteractionLoop --> ActionDispatch : [Continue]
InteractionLoop --> End : [Exit]

ActionDispatch --> AddNote : [Add Note]
ActionDispatch --> EditNote : [Edit Note]
ActionDispatch --> DeleteNote : [Delete Note]
ActionDispatch --> SignOut : [Sign Out]

AddNote --> InteractionLoop : Return to list

EditNote --> SaveChangesDecision : User edits note
SaveChangesDecision --> UpdateNote : [Save]
SaveChangesDecision --> DiscardChanges : [Cancel]

UpdateNote --> NetworkDecision : Update locally
NetworkDecision --> SyncFirebase : [Network available]
NetworkDecision --> QueueSync : [No network]
SyncFirebase --> ReturnToList
QueueSync --> ReturnToList
ReturnToList --> InteractionLoop
DiscardChanges --> InteractionLoop

DeleteNote --> ConfirmDeleteDecision : Show confirmation
ConfirmDeleteDecision --> PerformDeletion : [Confirm]
ConfirmDeleteDecision --> CancelDeletion : [Cancel]
PerformDeletion --> InteractionLoop
CancelDeletion --> InteractionLoop

SignOut --> ShowSignIn

ShowSignIn --> SignInDecision : User initiates Google Sign In
SignInDecision --> SignInSuccess : [Success]
SignInDecision --> SignInFailure : [Failure]

SignInSuccess --> ShowNotesList : Navigate to Notes List
SignInFailure --> ShowSignIn : Stay on Sign In Screen

@enduml
